                "content": "# LAMMPS input script for surface Aluminum energy calculation\n\n# Initialization\nunits metal\natom_style atomic\ndimension 3\nboundary p p f   # non\u2011periodic in z to create free surfaces\n\n# Read structure\nread_data Al_bulk.data\n\n# Replicate 5x5x5\nreplicate 5 5 5\n\n# Expand the simulation box in z to add vacuum (30 \u00c5 total length)\n# The current box length after replication is stored in variable Lz; we set a new length\nvariable Lz equal \"lz\"\nchange_box all z final 0 30 units box   # creates ~30 \u00c5 vacuum, enough to separate surfaces\n\n# Define potential\npair_style eam/alloy\npair_coeff * * /potentials/EAM/Al99.eam.alloy Al\n\n# Energy minimization\nmin_style cg\nminimize 1e-10 1e-10 100000 100000\n\n# Output final energy\nvariable natoms equal \"count(all)\"\nvariable etotal equal \"pe\"\nvariable eatom equal \"v_etotal/v_natoms\"\n\nprint \"Total atoms: ${natoms}\"\nprint \"Total energy: ${etotal} eV\"\nprint \"Energy per atom: ${eatom} eV/atom\"\n"
